sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pengguna
    participant View as "Web View (sidebar/navbar)"
    participant C as LoginController
    participant A as "AuditLog Model"
    participant U as "User Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pengguna->>View: Klik tombol Logout (POST /logout)
    View->>C: logout()

    C->>C: Validasi sesi autentikasi
    alt Data valid (sesi aktif)
        C->>A: Catat audit logout
        A->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs(action='logout', user_id, ...)
        C->>U: authService->logout(user)
        U->>DB: DELETE token API (jika ada)
        C->>DB: Invalidate session + regenerate CSRF token
        C-->>View: Redirect ke login + flash success
        View-->>Pengguna: Tampil halaman login
    else Data tidak valid (sesi tidak aktif)
        C-->>View: Redirect ke login
        View-->>Pengguna: Tampil halaman login
    end
